        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo MLP-111-630, Outswing Door Stainless Steel Mortise Latch Guard</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis satin stainless steel security door latch protector is 11\" high and designed specifically for outswing doors (door opens out of the room or building) with mortise locksets. For use on residential or commercial door applications. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nProtect your entry doors from tampering and latch prying with this heavy duty stainless steel security latch protector plate. No special tools required for installation. Packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available:  <a href=\"/products/outswing-door-steel-mortise-latch-guard-don-jo-mlp-211\"><b>Steel Latch Guard</b></a> in other finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-MLP-111-630_size.gif?v=1704354560\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo MLP-111-630 Security Latch Guard size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNon-Handed, reversible for left or right hand outswinging doors. Typlical used with <a href=\"/collections/omnia-mortise-entrysets\"><b>Mortise Locksets</b></a> but can also be used with <a href=\"/collections/omnia-tubular-entrysets\"><b>Tube Latch Type Locksets</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Don-Jo MLP-111-630 Stainless Security Latch Guard\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 12 Gauge (.104\")</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel </li>\r\n<li>Offset: 1/4\" (.250\") </li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed (reversible)</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: 2 each 5/16-18 x 2-1/4\" Carriage bolt with Acorn nuts and washers.</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MLP-111-630.pdf?v=1704262262\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo MLP-111-630 Security Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
